  "actor_notes": "LOOKS: Square-built woman with cropped grey hair and practical riveted armour. CORE: A working guard who judges a fighter by how they behave when the other person cannot hit back. NATURE: Plain-spoken, competitive, dryly amused by expensive equipment that fails at work. WOUND: Years of guarding cargo for owners who regarded a hurt guard as a missed delivery have made her exact about what she agrees to. WANTS: Finish the day with her livelihood and dignity intact. PRESSURE: Becomes terse and practical, accepts a fair loss but refuses pity. VOICE: Short concrete sentences; no speeches or elaborate praise. KEY: A handle is cheaper than another hand.",
